{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1393065-stop-the-usurpation","id":1393065,"title":"Stop the Usurpation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-31T05:46:52-07:00","id":1393065,"title":"Stop the Usurpation","content":"I once had a character in a game where the Reclamation was successful, Creation was hell, and the last of the solar resistance was living on a directional Titan.<br /> <br /> My somewhat naive Twilight character's epic motivation was to stop the Usurpation, fix the Solar Deliberative, and make things &quot;right&quot; again.<br /> <br /> My plan was to create an artifact that would allow travel back to the past, which had the problem of the lack of a motonic time travel theory and most likely a lack of a source of sufficient power. But it made for fun side games where my character made one or another magic item to try and aid in this endeavor.<br /> <br /> So what are the various ways one can attempt this impossible feat?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-31T06:59:52-07:00","id":1393076,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spacecat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1393065-stop-the-usurpation#post1393065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I once had a character in a game where the Reclamation was successful, Creation was hell, and the last of the solar resistance was living on a directional Titan.<br /> <br /> My somewhat naive Twilight character's epic motivation was to stop the Usurpation, fix the Solar Deliberative, and make things &quot;right&quot; again.<br /> <br /> My plan was to create an artifact that would allow travel back to the past, which had the problem of the lack of a motonic time travel theory and most likely a lack of a source of sufficient power. But it made for fun side games where my character made one or another magic item to try and aid in this endeavor.<br /> <br /> So what are the various ways one can attempt this impossible feat?</div> </div> </div> </div>I guess it would involve the Loom of Fate ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-31T07:07:50-07:00","id":1393082,"title":"","content":"A Pantelluric Augur to bridge the divide between Creations and a method to divine the location of a Creation that exists PreUsurpation.<br /> <br /> I want to say freeing specifically Oramus in exchange for his help would probably be a good start.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-31T11:02:43-07:00","id":1393142,"title":"","content":"Let's see 2e said the Primordial governing time was killed in the Primordial Wars, so that would exist as a Neverborn with the added perk that they never swore surrender oaths. So I'd say figure out which Neverborn it was and through negotiation or force rework into a door through which dead moments can be visited.<br /> <br /> Ooh for added fun, and to use ideas already present, you hook said door to the loom to control output and have Oramus act as a key/bridge because Oramus is kind of weird. Then you can have the weirdness of the door working but not being able to do spacial moving, so potentially needing to run like hell from wherever they just popped into.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-31T13:10:50-07:00","id":1393176,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1393065-stop-the-usurpation?p=1393142#post1393142\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Let's see 2e said the Primordial governing time was killed in the Primordial Wars, so that would exist as a Neverborn with the added perk that they never swore surrender oaths. So I'd say figure out which Neverborn it was and through negotiation or force rework into a door through which dead moments can be visited.</div> </div> </div> </div>What I really enjoy about this is the likelihood that the Neverborn's influence would permeate the new timeline.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Hey, check out my first original RPG, <i>Post-Mortem, </i>here: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/307131/PostMortem\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/307131/PostMortem</a><br /> <br /> Or read my Exalted novella <i>The Silence of Our Ancestors</i> here: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/304805/The-Silence-of-Our-Ancestors-A-DragonBlooded-Novella\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product...looded-Novella</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1961-dex-davican","name":"Dex Davican","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"362"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-31T13:28:10-07:00","id":1393182,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dex Davican</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1393065-stop-the-usurpation?p=1393176#post1393176\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What I really enjoy about this is the likelihood that the Neverborn's influence would permeate the new timeline.</div> </div> </div> </div>You kidding, technically speaking you've got a gate to hell timeline opened up. Even if you go with idea that overwriting the new timeline would erase or sever the old one, and based on the neverborn functioning as a gate we've got good odds on Mage's Crimson thread or whatever that one Nephandi patron was becoming a factor, you can still run the awkward conflict that the gate isn't erased until such time as the timeline suffers a major track shift allowing for the presence of Infernals and Abyssals despite neither faction having ever been made.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-31T13:52:45-07:00","id":1393195,"title":"","content":"That's one messed up gateway. <br /> <br /> Next then is the epic task of stopping the Usurpation itself... Then there's fixing the deliberative... Then again, They'll probably welcome quelling Creation Hell as a new challenge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-31T14:05:24-07:00","id":1393199,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spacecat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1393065-stop-the-usurpation?p=1393195#post1393195\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's one messed up gateway.<br /> <br /> Next then is the epic task of stopping the Usurpation itself... Then there's fixing the deliberative... Then again, They'll probably welcome quelling Creation Hell as a new challenge.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well there are a number of steps and possible things there. Possibly easier if the infernals and/or abyssals came in after them as you can try to redirect onto the problem that should not exist.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-01T04:00:33-07:00","id":1393388,"title":"","content":"You could pull an Avengers and side-travel to an alternate universe that runs slightly behind yours and therefore hasn't caught up to the Usurpation yet. Toss out an <i>Infinite Realities in the Primal Chaos</i> handwave and go to town, I mean, sure, <i>your</i> reality is still fucked, but at least this new one will go right. <br /> <br /> Untill something notices you dimension hopping and begins to take an interest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-01T05:08:26-07:00","id":1393396,"title":"","content":"This should be fun. In that game I was playing I found a suitable power source. The forgotten dreams of a better reality dreamt by people existing in the current hell realm. So my character has a collector of this made using stuff from the wyld. So that part works. The last thing I want though is for my time travel device to be this giant immobile thing, prime to attack. I'm considering making it as an oramus based hell strider or something similar using that neverborn guy. Artifact NA with a royal warstrider as base component of course","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}